- [HTML — MDN Web Docs](https://developer.mozilla.org/en-US/docs/Web/HTML)""" <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#sameAs> "# HTML\n\n**HTML (HyperText Markup Language)** is the standard markup language for creating documents designed to be displayed in a web browser.\n\nHTML provides the base structure for content, which is then styled with [CSS](CSS.md) and can support functionality via JavaScript. Modern HTML supports embedding semantics natively through [Microdata](Microdata.md).\n\n## References\n\n- [HTML Living Standard](https://html.spec.whatwg.org/)\n- [HTML — MDN Web Docs](https://developer.mozilla.org/en-US/docs/Web/HTML)" .
