<https://wazootech.github.io/wiki/Turtle> <https://schema.org/articleBody> "# Turtle\n\n**Turtle** (Terse RDF Triple Language) is a syntax and file format for expressing data in the [RDF](RDF.md) data model.\n\nTurtle is very compact and readable by humans, which makes it the most common syntax used to manually write RDF data and axioms.\n\nIt is a subset of [Notation3](Notation3.md) and a superset of the minimal [N Triples](N_Triples.md) format.\n\n## Related\n\n- [RDF](RDF.md)\n- [N Triples](N_Triples.md)\n- [Notation3](Notation3.md)\n- [TriG](TriG.md)\n- [JSON LD](JSON_LD.md)\n- [wiki export](wiki_export.md)\n\n## References\n\n- [RDF 1.1 Turtle](https://www.w3.org/TR/turtle/)" .
