<https://wazootech.github.io/wiki/TypeScript_API_Reference> <https://schema.org/articleBody> "# TypeScript API Reference\n\nThe TypeScript API is generated from TSDoc annotations in the `npm/src/` source tree using [TypeDoc](https://typedoc.org/). Source files live in `npm/src/`.\n\n- [Full API Reference](https://wazootech.github.io/wiki/assets/api/ts/)\n\nThe [Wiki Programmatic API](Wiki_Programmatic_API.md) page provides usage examples and design rationale.\n\n## Related\n\n- [Wiki Programmatic API](Wiki_Programmatic_API.md) — usage guide\n- [Python API Reference](Python_API_Reference.md) — Python library reference" .
