<https://wiki.example.org/people/Alice_Smith> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#sameAs> <https://wiki.example.org/people/Alice_Smith> .
<https://wiki.example.org/people/Alice_Smith> <http://xmlns.com/foaf/0.1/knows> <https://wiki.example.org/people/Bob_Jones> .
